WEBVTT

00:07:58.557 --> 00:08:00.976
So Sandy decided to write her mom a note,

00:08:00.976 --> 00:08:03.562
and she included
an honoring set of memories

00:08:03.562 --> 00:08:05.856
about what she did love about her mom.

00:08:06.941 --> 00:08:08.651
She called me later, she said,

00:08:08.692 --> 00:08:09.902
"You know what?

00:08:10.486 --> 00:08:11.946
It was like magic.

00:08:12.988 --> 00:08:15.241
I started liking my mom.

00:08:16.367 --> 00:08:18.035
I forgave her.

00:08:18.953 --> 00:08:20.663
I felt compassion for her.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.415
My heart got softer."

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:28.045
Here's the thing.

00:08:28.587 --> 00:08:30.339
When we're writing a Gracenote,